    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah i get that. it's just that the area is starting to look a bit swollen and it feels kinda tender now when i press on it. i also feel a little bit feverish today. do u think it's just the inflammation from the 'ringworm' or should i be worried about something else? i'm really trying to avoid the clinic if possible.",
